This file disables Jekyll processing on GitHub Pages.

FROGSHIN is plain static files — HTML, CSS and ES modules — and needs no
build step at all. Jekyll was running on every deploy regardless, which
bought nothing and, on 2026-09-01, started failing outright ("Page build
failed") and left the live site stuck on the previous version.

With this file present Pages publishes the tree verbatim: faster deploys,
and one entire class of failure removed.
